<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 64,573.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 64,573.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Oct 22 totaled 64,573 bales, up from 62,693 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,880 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 6,242 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
